Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:14:42 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Restore the original TU boundaries around main_01b/main_01c

main_01a and the stage loop up to DemoPlay() are one TU; the random
number ring, cfg_load(), the game over menu, GameExecl()/sub_C5B0() and
player_invalidate() are separate ones. Each original TU's relocations
form their own LEDATA chunks in the target's relocation table.
---
